\* 已知操作所需 Reference（含 Predecessor）→ O(1)；需 Traversal 找目标 Node / Predecessor → O(n)

- **Index Access**
  - **Array**：Index → 计算对应 Memory Address → 直接访问，O(1)
  - **Linked List**：Index 无法直接算出 Node 的 Memory Address；`next` 存下一个 Node 的 Reference → 从 `head` 沿 References Traversal，建 **Counter** 数到目标 Node，O(n)

**Linked List — Java Operations (Time)**

```operations-table
{
  "columns": [
    "Operation",
    "Singly (next)",
    "Doubly (prev + next)"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "见第 1 节 Structure 上图：已初始化 head → A → B → C → D → E，tail → E；b → B，c → C，n = new Node(7)。各行操作独立执行"
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "operation": "Insert N after C",
      "singly": {
        "code": [
          "n.next = c.next;",
          "c.next = n;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Given c → O(1)",
          "Need to find c by Traversal → O(n)"
        ]
      },
      "doubly": {
        "code": [
          "n.prev = c;",
          "n.next = c.next;",
          "c.next.prev = n;",
          "c.next = n;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Given c → O(1)",
          "Need to find c by Traversal → O(n)"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "operation": "Delete C",
      "singly": {
        "code": [
          "b.next = c.next;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Given predecessor b → O(1)",
          "Given c only → Traversal to find b → O(n)"
        ]
      },
      "doubly": {
        "code": [
          "c.prev.next = c.next;",
          "c.next.prev = c.prev;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Given c: O(1)"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "operation": "Delete Head",
      "singly": {
        "code": [
          "head = head.next;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "O(1)"
        ]
      },
      "doubly": {
        "code": [
          "head = head.next;",
          "head.prev = null;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "O(1)"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "operation": "Delete Tail",
      "singly": {
        "code": [
          "Node p = head;",
          "while (p.next != tail) {",
          "    p = p.next;",
          "}",
          "p.next = null;",
          "tail = p;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "O(n)",
          "Traversal to find predecessor of tail"
        ]
      },
      "doubly": {
        "code": [
          "tail = tail.prev;",
          "tail.next = null;"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "O(1) · tail.prev is available"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
